    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've checked the windows and the doors, they're tight. no drafts. it's almost like there's a presence in the house just sucking the cold right out of the air. i know that sounds crazy, but i've seen this happen before where things just act up for no reason, like some kind of unseen nuisance is making a mess of the settings or the airflow. since you're the expert, is there any way something small and hidden could be messing with the system and then hiding again?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
